From efa56da72b53236956543ec4c6191c8c855dd376 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: WeiguangTWK <weiguangtwk@outlook.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 18:58:53 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Neko LineageOS: [ASTER] Bind FAS control to host policy and
 boot evidence

Add shared host-side policy and FAS boot-record helpers for lease validation,
instance continuity and boot-sticky submission tracking.

Update fasd to use the policy-aware backend context and status interfaces,
preserving the existing control path while rejecting stale grants or changed
instances. Retain explicit stop and interruption evidence instead of claiming
that a QTI hardware release has completed.

Include the host lease, mode and shutdown models alongside the shared headers.

Change-Id: I2db9e89ed295da952b876eb06fe73f401eed9627
